# Desert's Due: -2/-2 and an additional -1/-1 for each Desert YOU control. Bot1 controls one Desert (Desert) and Bot2 one as well:
# only Bot1's counts (CR 109.4), so Boneyard Desecrator (3/4) gets -3/-3 and is left a 0/1 (one more would kill it). The Deserts
# are counted as it resolves and the effect lasts until the turn ends (CR 611.2a, 514.2): on turn 4 the Desecrator is a 3/4 again.

